[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9240.95, "timestamp": "02:34:00", "text": "是的。是的。是的。等待。我当时想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9244.07, "timestamp": "02:34:04", "text": "他不应该杀我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9248.309, "timestamp": "02:34:08", "text": "呃，谁？那个鬼魂。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9251.59, "timestamp": "02:34:11", "text": "呃，是哪个鬼魂？事情发生了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9256.11, "timestamp": "02:34:16", "text": "哈，萦绕在我们心头。哦，那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9258.71, "timestamp": "02:34:18", "text": "带有白色眼睛的黑色球体或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9261.11, "timestamp": "02:34:21", "text": "某物。或者那条贯穿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9263.83, "timestamp": "02:34:23", "text": "走廊。是的，那个来的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9267.03, "timestamp": "02:34:27", "text": "我们躲藏的时候，他们正好撞见了我们。哦，那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9269.19, "timestamp": "02:34:29", "text": "不，那个不会伤害你。那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9271.349, "timestamp": "02:34:31", "text": "真正伤害你的是内心的那个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9272.429, "timestamp": "02:34:32", "text": "你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9275.429, "timestamp": "02:34:35", "text": "橱柜。当你待在那里的时候就会发生这种情况。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9277.19, "timestamp": "02:34:37", "text": "就像如果你一直待在黑暗中太久一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9278.79, "timestamp": "02:34:38", "text": "长时间或长时间待在这个橱柜里太久了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9281.19, "timestamp": "02:34:41", "text": "时间长了，就会开始伤害你，让你痛苦不堪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9283.19, "timestamp": "02:34:43", "text": "你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9286.75, "timestamp": "02:34:46", "text": "这是什么蓝光？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9290.95, "timestamp": "02:34:50", "text": "呃，我，我的意思是，我想我是在说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9293.469, "timestamp": "02:34:53", "text": "没什么。我想，那只是些门而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9296.91, "timestamp": "02:34:56", "text": "就像这样，大部分时间都在倒退，但是"}]